          "text": "……前菜の準備はどうなっている？",
          "position": "center",
          "background": "kitchen"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialog",
          "character": "elodie",
          "text": "C'est prêt ! (準備できています！)",
          "position": "center",
          "background": "kitchen"
